meta {
  name: (1-3) Read Group
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{domain}}/groups/{{groupId}}
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Accept: application/x-fs-v1+json
}

vars:pre-request {
  token: 
}

docs {
  The /groups/{groupId} endpoint gets the details for the user tree group specified by groupId.
  
  If the status code from this request is 200 OK, the details of the group will be in the response body.  **Note** (1-3-1) Read Groups shows how to list all the groups. Proceed to (1-4) Trees.
}
